{
  "uid": "model-api-callers",
  "title": "Model API callers",
  "tags": [
    "fleet",
    "litellm",
    "access"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "editable": false,
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Who called the model API.** Per key: LiteLLM's spend log (every caller, front door or :4000), read on dgx-1 by `litellm-usage-exporter` (read-only DB role, column grants only; role `litellm_usage_exporter`, runbooks/litellm.md). Per source: the front door's access log in Loki (`model.nghodki.ai`, runbooks/edge.md). The two meet on `api_key_hash` (first 8 hex of SHA-256 of the key); no key or full hash is stored here. Source node: `10.42.1.x` dgx-1, `10.42.0.x` dgx-2, `10.42.2.x` Jetson, `10.42.3.x` Dell. k3s nodes appear as themselves; any other client (Pi, Mac, phone) appears as the node that took its connection. Time-series counters start when the exporter starts; the 24 h numbers come straight from the DB."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requests, last 24 h",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "defenseclaw-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "defenseclaw-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(litellm_usage_last24h_requests)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Failed, last 24 h",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "defenseclaw-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "defenseclaw-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(litellm_usage_last24h_requests{status!=\"success\"}) / sum(litellm_usage_last24h_requests)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.05
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.2
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tokens, last 24 h",
